%- named-child traversal: a single-arg node collapses to that argument
<:for pkg in {./package.kdl}
 <div > {pkg.dependencies.lodash}
 <div > {pkg.versions[2]}
 <div > {pkg.versions[-1]}
 <ul > <:for v in {pkg.versions} > <li > {v}
 <div > {pkg.version}
 <div > {pkg["version"]}
 <div > {pkg["dependencies"]["lodash"]}
 <div > {pkg.scripts.build}
 <div > {pkg.flags[0]}
 <div > {pkg.flags[1]}

%- data file + path traversal in one expression
<div > {./package.kdl.tags[1]}
<div > {./package.kdl.version}